 neurons in the brain coordinate to create a coherent mind. Gödel, Escher, Bach won the Pulitzer Prize for General Nonfiction and the National Book Award for Science Hardcover.","matchedBy":"infobox_book:high","confidence":"high","attribution":{"label":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/G%C3%B6del%2C_Escher%2C_Bach","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"},"infobox":{"title":"Gödel, Escher, Bach:; an Eternal Golden Braid","author":"Douglas Hofstadter","publisher":"Basic Books","publicationDate":"1979","publicationPlace":"United States","pages":"777","isbn":"978-0-465-02656-2","language":"English"},"publisherEvidenceId":"publisher-evidence-wikipedia-godel-escher-bach-an-eternal-golden-braid-douglas-hofstadter"},"sources":[{"id":"source-award-record-national-book-awards-science-hardcover-wikipedia-national-book-award-for-nonfiction","label":"Wikipedia: National Book Award for Nonfiction","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Book_Award_for_Nonfiction","accessedAt":"2026-08-01T20:39:08.468Z","confidence":"secondary","field":"award","note":"Official archive URL: https://www.nationalbook.org/national-book-awards/search/"},{"id":"source-award-record-pulitzer-general-nonfiction-wikipedia-pulitzer-prize-for-general-nonfiction","label":"Wikipedia: Pulitzer Prize for General Nonfiction","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pulitzer_Prize_for_General_Nonfiction","accessedAt":"2026-08-01T20:39:08.468Z","confidence":"secondary","field":"award","note":"Official category URL: https://www.pulitzer.org/prize-winners-by-category/223"},{"id":"source-publisher-cleanup-curation","label":"Manual publisher/imprint cleanup for generated catalog metadata","url":"","confidence":"manual","note":"Maps catalog-provider publisher strings that are actually imprints or aliases onto curated parent publishers and imprint records."},{"id":"source-google-books-godel-escher-bach-an-eternal-golden-braid-douglas-hofstadter","label":"Google